# Regenerated on install. Nothing here pins a version the registry does not
# already resolve, and a library is better tested against the newest of them.
# The fixture site floats for the same reason: a Docusaurus or MDX release that
# breaks a figure should turn CI red the week it lands, not the day someone
# gets around to bumping a pin.
